If $L>B_0$, then $O_L$ recovers the exact current quantity on $K_{B_0}$, and $\widehat B_L$ recovers the exact composition there. Ordered tree syntax need not be recovered in general: for $B_0\ge5$, the two trees $\langle A,B\rangle$ and $\langle B,A\rangle$ have the same composition and quantity and remain indistinguishable.

